WEBVTT

00:00:58.700 --> 00:01:00.658
I want to share with you a demonstration

00:01:00.658 --> 00:01:03.670
conceived by sports scientist Ross Tucker.

00:01:03.670 --> 00:01:05.835
Now picture the stadium last year

00:01:05.835 --> 00:01:08.464
at the world championships of the 100 meters:

00:01:08.464 --> 00:01:10.563
thousands of fans waiting with baited breath

00:01:10.563 --> 00:01:14.037
to see Usain Bolt, the fastest man in history;

00:01:14.037 --> 00:01:16.912
flashbulbs popping as the
nine fastest men in the world

00:01:16.912 --> 00:01:19.475
coil themselves into their blocks.

00:01:19.475 --> 00:01:20.606
And I want you to pretend

00:01:20.606 --> 00:01:22.945
that Jesse Owens is in that race.

00:01:22.945 --> 00:01:26.190
Now close your eyes for a
second and picture the race.

00:01:26.190 --> 00:01:27.882
Bang! The gun goes off.

00:01:27.882 --> 00:01:29.950
An American sprinter jumps out to the front.

00:01:29.950 --> 00:01:31.900
Usain Bolt starts to catch him.